B.a4a=new A.cy("What is this?","Calculates the height loss Below the Take-Off Surface (BTS) during a Continued Take-Off (CTO) on one engine (OEI) from an elevated offshore helideck, using the chart from AW139 RFM Supplement 97.",null)
B.a4O=new A.cy("Procedure summary","A vertical climb at 400\u2013500 fpm (using 25% \u0394PI) above the helideck reaches the Take-Off Decision Point (TDP) at 25 ft (7.5 m). A nose-down rotation then begins for the flyaway.\n\nEngine failure before TDP: reject back to the helideck (RTO).\nEngine failure at or after TDP: continue the rotation for CTO OEI \u2014 a drop down BTS may be required.\n\nThe procedure always assures deck-edge clearance (\u2265 15 ft vertical, \u2265 35 ft horizontal) and no exposure to ditching.\n\nThe helicopter nose wheel must be positioned 1.5 \u2013 4.0 m from the helideck edge before commencing the manoeuvre.",null)
B.a4r=new A.cy("1 \u2014 Gross Weight","Enter the aircraft all-up weight in kg (5 800 \u2013 7 000 kg) or lb. Toggle the kg/lb button to convert automatically.",null)
B.a4D=new A.cy("2 \u2014 Pressure Altitude",'Pressure altitude of the helideck in feet (\u22121 000 to +1 000 ft).\nUse "Calculate from MSL & QNH" to convert from a QNH setting if needed.',null)
B.a4I=new A.cy("3 \u2014 OAT","Outside air temperature in \xb0C.",null)
B.a4M=new A.cy("4 \u2014 Headwind","Unfactored headwind component in knots. The maximum is automatically limited to the upper boundary of the wind nomogram for the current conditions and adjusts as inputs change.",null)
B.a4L=new A.cy("Result","Height loss BTS in feet. 0 ft means conditions fall below the chart's lower boundary \u2014 no meaningful drop down is required.\n\nThe red trace shows: PA/OAT (left graph) \u2192 wind nomogram (centre) \u2192 GW curve (right graph) \u2192 height loss on the x-axis.",null)
B.a4m=new A.cy("Helideck height requirement","If a drop down is indicated, the helideck elevation above the sea (or obstacles) must exceed the computed drop down plus the clearance margin required by the Competent Authority. There must be no obstacles beyond and below the deck edge.",null)
B.a4d=new A.cy("Chart","Tap the chart to open it full-screen with pan and zoom.",null)
B.aTp=s([B.a4a,B.a4O,B.a4r,B.a4D,B.a4I,B.a4M,B.a4L,B.a4m,B.a4d],t.p)
B.e4=new A.u0(0,"kg")
B.b2X=new A.mY("kg",B.e4)
B.bf6=new A.u0(1,"lb")
