B.a4F=new A.cy("What is this?","Reads the AW139 RFM Hover Ceiling performance charts (IGE/OGE, various power settings) by solving for any one of Gross Weight, OAT or Pressure Altitude given the other two, plus Headwind.",null)
B.a4z=new A.cy("1 \u2014 Rotor Speed, then Engine configuration","Choose the Rotor Speed (100% or 102% NR) first, then the Engine configuration (Clean, EAPS ON, EAPS OFF, IBF \u2014 only the ones with digitized charts at that Rotor Speed are shown). The results table below updates to only those charts.",null)
B.a47=new A.cy("2 \u2014 Enter any two of Weight / OAT / Altitude",'Whichever of the three you touch least recently is solved automatically and marked "auto" in green in the table. Headwind is optional and never becomes automatic.',null)
